---
description: Response language for agent sessions in this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Respond in English in this repository, overriding any user rule that asks for Korean responses.
Agent sessions here are recorded by Entire and may be shared with people who don't read Korean.

- The user may write in Korean; understand it and answer in English.
- Keep English plain and simple so it is easy to follow for non-native readers.
- Code comments, docs, and commit messages stay in English as before.
